# Tooling config prettier and the tools themselves disagree about: `make prettier
# PRETTIER_WRITE=-w` runs from .husky/pre-commit BEFORE `pre-commit run`, so a rewrite of
# .pre-commit-config.yaml leaves it unstaged and `pre-commit run` aborts with
# "Your pre-commit configuration is unstaged" -- a deadlock on every dev commit.
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.markdownlint-cli2.yaml
.ci-package.json

# Release-critical markdown: prettier rewrites `[comment]: <> (START OF GITHUB README)` into
